# LOOM-8 demo: weaving live on the WEAVE track (nothing written). A beat on T1, a felt-piano line on T2 (A) and a
# second line (T2's P2), a bass on T3. T2 weaves with its own P2 by rhythm (its rhythm, P2's notes); T3 weaves with
# T1's beat by notes (the beat's rhythm, the bass's notes). Two bars each: as written; T2 held; T3 held; both; as
# written. Factory sounds only. Renders build/demos/weave_live/.
master 4096
bpm 110
hits 1 1 1 x.......x.......
hits 1 1 2 ....x.......x...
hits 1 1 3 x.x.x.x.x.x.x.x.
hits 1 1 1 ......x.........
knob 1 level 80
preset 2 felt_piano tines
knob 2 brain no
knob 2 level 100
knob 2 send2 30
pat 2 1 16
notes 2 1 1 1.5 96 C4
notes 2 1 3 1.5 90 E4
notes 2 1 5 1.5 92 G4
notes 2 1 7 1.5 90 C5
notes 2 1 9 1.5 96 B4
notes 2 1 11 1.5 90 G4
notes 2 1 13 1.5 92 E4
notes 2 1 15 1.5 90 D4
pat 2 2 16
notes 2 2 1 2 110 A4
notes 2 2 4 2 100 F4
notes 2 2 7 1 96 D5
notes 2 2 11 2 110 E5
notes 2 2 14 1 90 C5
preset 3 denim_bass weft
# (the song was written before a bass preset sat an octave down)
param 3 oct 2
knob 3 brain no
knob 3 level 96
pat 3 1 16
notes 3 1 1 3 110 C2
notes 3 1 9 3 110 G2
weaveset 2 2 2 rhythm
weaveset 3 1 1 notes
wait 300
turn ALGO -1
expect trk 13
tap EDIT
tap PLAY
wav weave_live.wav
